    "body": "Depends on: 4-way Gate C harness (part of #64 finish) and canonical bits/token. Record the 4-way Gate C table per main commit (small corpus slice for speed) as a CI artifact with a regression threshold (e.g. top-1 drops > 2 points or bits/token worsens > 0.1 vs the pinned previous record → fail or loud annotation). Acceptance: ci.yml uploads the trend JSON; two consecutive commits demonstrate the alarm path on a synthetic regression.\n\n\n---\n\n## Definition of Done\n- CI records the 4-way Gate C table (small corpus slice) per main commit as an artifact, with a regression alarm on a pinned threshold.\n- The alarm path is demonstrated end-to-end.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] ci.yml uploads the trend JSON per run with commit metadata.\n- [ ] A synthetic regression (top-1 drop > 2 points or bits/token +0.1 vs pinned previous) demonstrably triggers the alarm in CI logs.\n- [ ] The threshold and the trend artifact location are documented in the workflow header.",
